# Structures that engine/disc.situ must accept, checked by `make test`
# with `situc verify`: each cut from an image engine/iso.c wrote of a
# tree with a directory, a file and a subdirectory, so the schema and
# the writer are held to the same bytes.

# pvd: the volume descriptor of a disc hull wrote: CD001, a 2048-byte block, the root record at 156
